      <title>City to Pursue Bringing 30,000 Cubic Yards of Sand to North Beach</title>
      <link>https://www.picketfencemedia.com/sanclementetimes/city-to-pursue-bringing-30-000-cubic-yards-of-sand-to-north-beach/article_bb4a1460-238a-11ef-a7d6-2f86db11ea44.html</link>
      <description>The San Clemente City Council unanimously voted at its Tuesday, June 4 meeting to authorize actions that would bring approximately 30,000 cubic yards of sand to North Beach, suspending the Sand Compatibility and Opportunistic Use Program in the process.</description>
